  "b0c8j292wf": {"title":"Makimoo Travel Neck Pillow 360 Degree Head and Neck Support Memory Foam U Shaped Pillow with Adjustable Snap Button and Carry Bag for Airplane Car Train Bus Home Sleeping (Pink)","bullets":"360-Degree Support for Restful Sleep: The curved U-shaped design cradles your head, neck, and chin in natural alignment, helping reduce stiffness and muscle fatigue on long flights, road trips, train rides, or daily commutes. Raised side supports help keep your head from tilting or falling forward so you can relax more fully.\n\nResponsive Memory Foam Comfort: Filled with slow-rebound memory foam that gently molds to your unique contours and evenly distributes pressure, then springs back to shape after each use. The plush, skin-friendly cover adds a soft touch for comfortable rest in any season.\n\nAdjustable Snap-Button Fit: Features a secure dual-snap closure that lets you customize the fit around your neck and keep the pillow in place while seated upright. The snaps also make it easy to fasten the pillow to a bag or suitcase strap for hands-free carrying.\n\nPortable Travel Set with Carry Bag: Includes a lightweight drawstring storage bag that keeps the pillow clean and compact when not in use. Slip it into your carry-on, backpack, or car seat pocket for cushioned support wherever you go.\n\nVersatile Companion for Any Journey: Ideal for airplanes, cars, trains, buses, recliners, office chairs, and home use. The soft pink finish and clean look make it a thoughtful choice for frequent travelers, students, and anyone who values comfort on the move.","sku":"US-7EPNJD","images":["/images/products/B0C8J292WF/3.webp","/images/products/B0C8J292WF/1.webp","/images/products/B0C8J292WF/2.webp","/images/products/B0C8J292WF/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true,true,true]},
