  "b0c2zcxvx7": {"title":"Makimoo Hump-Shaped Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow with Adjustable Toggle Strap Zippered Soft Velvet Cover Ergonomic Head Support for Airplane Car Train Office Napping (Blue)","bullets":"Ergonomic Hump Design: The contoured shape cradles your neck, chin, and head to help maintain natural alignment during flights, road trips, train rides, or office naps.\n\nResponsive Memory Foam Core: High-density memory foam gently molds to your contours and rebounds slowly, delivering consistent cushioning without flattening.\n\nAdjustable Toggle Strap: A sturdy cord with an easy-slide lock lets you customize the fit around your neck, keeping the pillow secure as you relax or sleep upright.\n\nSoft Velvet and Breathable Mesh Cover: The plush velvet exterior feels gentle on skin, while the breathable mesh panel helps airflow; the zippered design allows convenient removal for cleaning.\n\nCompact Travel Set: Includes a lightweight drawstring storage bag so you can roll the pillow down, tuck it away, and carry it in your luggage, backpack, or handbag.","sku":"US-MLYJLF","images":["/images/products/B0C2ZCXVX7/1.webp","/images/products/B0C2ZCXVX7/2.webp","/images/products/B0C2ZCXVX7/3.webp","/images/products/B0C2ZCXVX7/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,true,true,true]},
  "b0c2z9pffk": {"title":"Makimoo Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow Ergonomic Hump Shaped Design Soft Supportive Cushion with Adjustable Drawstring Carry Bag for Airplane Car Train Office Naps (Grey)","bullets":"Ergonomic Hump Design: The contoured shape cradles your neck, chin, and head to help maintain natural alignment while seated, making long flights, road trips, and commutes more comfortable.\n\nPremium Memory Foam Core: Made with high-density slow-rebound memory foam that gently molds to your curves and returns to shape after use, providing consistent support without flattening.\n\nAdjustable Drawstring Closure: A sturdy cord with a spring-loaded toggle lets you tighten or loosen the fit around your neck, keeping the pillow secure whether you lean back or to the side.\n\nSoft Breathable Cover: The outer plush fabric feels gentle against skin, while the inner mesh lining promotes airflow to help you stay cool and relaxed during rest.\n\nTravel-Friendly Carry Bag: The included lightweight drawstring pouch keeps the pillow clean and compact, so you can easily tuck it into a backpack, suitcase, or tote.","sku":"US-TA9C0Y","images":["/images/products/B0C2Z9PFFK/1.webp","/images/products/B0C2Z9PFFK/2.webp","/images/products/B0C2Z9PFFK/3.webp","/images/products/B0C2Z9PFFK/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,true,true,true]},
  "b0bzcmdzns": {"title":"U Shaped Memory Foam Neck Pillow With Adjustable Snap Closure Soft Velvet Removable Cover Travel Pillow For Airplane Car Train Office Napping With Compact Carry Bag (Grey)","bullets":"Ergonomic Memory Foam Support: The contoured U-shape gently cradles your neck and head to help maintain natural alignment and reduce fatigue during long flights, road trips, train rides, or office breaks.\n\nAdjustable Snap Closure: A sturdy buckle with multiple snap settings lets you secure the pillow loosely or snugly around your neck, giving you personalized comfort and stable support while sleeping upright.\n\nSoft Velvet Removable Cover: The plush, breathable velvet cover feels smooth against skin and unzips easily for quick removal and machine washing, keeping your pillow fresh trip after trip.\n\nCompact Travel Design: The pillow rolls up neatly into the included drawstring carry bag, saving valuable luggage space and protecting the pillow from dust when stored at home or on the go.\n\nVersatile Everyday Comfort: Ideal for airplanes, cars, buses, trains, camping, and desk naps, this pillow offers reliable neck support for adults and teens during commutes, vacations, and relaxing afternoons.","sku":"US-Z03AX2","images":["/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/1.webp","/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/2.webp","/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/3.webp","/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,true,true,true]},
  "b0bzcln57s": {"title":"Makimoo Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow U Shaped With Adjustable Snap Closure Portable Drawstring Bag Breathable Soft Cover For Airplane Car Train Bus Home Office Naps (Black)","bullets":"360-Degree Ergonomic Neck Support: The U-shaped design wraps gently around your neck and chin to help keep your head upright and aligned while sitting. It helps reduce neck strain during long flights, road trips, train rides, or bus commutes.\n\nPremium Memory Foam Filling: Made with responsive memory foam combined with microbeads, this pillow molds to the natural curve of your neck and returns to shape within 5 seconds. The balanced softness and support help relieve pressure points for more relaxed rest.\n\nBreathable and Sweat-Resistant Cover: The soft velvet-like cover allows airflow to help keep you cool and comfortable during extended use. It feels gentle against skin and resists sweat buildup, making it suitable for warm cabins or long journeys.\n\nAdjustable Snap Closure with Travel Bag: A side snap button lets you secure the pillow comfortably under your chin or attach it to a bag when not in use. The included lightweight drawstring bag makes packing and carrying easy for travel.\n\nLightweight and Versatile for Anywhere: Use it on airplanes, in cars, on trains or buses, or while relaxing at home or in the office. Its compact, portable design makes it a practical companion for commuting, napping, reading, or watching TV.","sku":"US-CQ168O","images":["/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/2.webp","/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/3.webp","/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/4.webp","/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/1.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,true]},
  "b0bxckknn8": {"title":"Makimoo Travel Neck Pillow Memory Foam U-Shaped Support with Hump Design Adjustable Strap Soft Breathable Removable Cover Machine Washable for Airplane Car Office Rest (Black)","bullets":"Ergonomic Hump Design for Comfortable Support: The contoured U-shaped memory foam gently cradles your head, neck, and chin to help maintain natural alignment while you rest during flights, road trips, or train rides.\n\nPremium Slow-Rebound Memory Foam Core: High-density memory foam adapts to your unique shape and provides balanced cushioning that relieves pressure points, then slowly returns to its original form after each use.\n\nSoft, Breathable and Machine-Washable Cover: The skin-friendly outer fabric features breathable mesh panels to keep air flowing, while the zippered cover removes easily for convenient cleaning between trips.\n\nAdjustable Toggle Closure for a Secure Fit: The front cord lock lets you tighten or loosen the pillow around your neck, so it stays comfortably in place whether you are sitting upright in a plane or reclining in a car.\n\nTravel-Ready with a Compact Carry Bag: Lightweight and compressible, this neck pillow includes a drawstring storage bag that keeps it clean and easy to pack in your carry-on, backpack, or luggage.","sku":"US-Y6J0CA","images":["/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/1.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/2.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/3.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/4.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,true,true,true,true]},
