  "b0c3b16l6r": {"title":"Makimoo Set of 2 Outdoor Chair Cushions with Ties, Durable Polyester All Weather Patio Seat Back Cushion for Garden Furniture, Thick Padded Plaid Pattern, 110 x 55 cm (Green)","bullets":"Complete 2-Pack Set: Refresh your patio with two matching chair cushions, each measuring approximately 110 x 55cm to fit most standard high-back outdoor and dining chairs.\n\nDurable Weather Resistant Cover: Made from 100% polyester, the outdoor-ready shell handles sun exposure and light rain while keeping the green lattice print looking fresh.\n\nSecure Corner Ties: Integrated ties at the top and bottom of each cushion let you fasten them firmly to chairs, helping prevent shifting or blowing away on breezy days.\n\nThick Padded Comfort: Plush polyester fill cushions both the seat and back, delivering supportive relaxation for long meals, conversations, and lazy afternoons outside.\n\nVersatile Outdoor Style: The classic green plaid lattice pattern complements wood, wicker, and metal furniture on patios, decks, balconies, and gardens.","sku":"US-Z4WKO6","images":["/images/products/B0C3B16L6R/1.webp","/images/products/B0C3B16L6R/5.webp","/images/products/B0C3B16L6R/2.webp","/images/products/B0C3B16L6R/3.webp","/images/products/B0C3B16L6R/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,true,true]},
