  "b0c6h5xzmz": {"title":"Makimoo Set of 4 Outdoor Chair Cushions Patio High Back Seat Cushions with Ties 110 x 55 cm All Weather Fade Resistant Polyester Garden Dining Chair Pads Green Lattice (Green)","bullets":"Complete Set of Four: Receive four matching outdoor chair cushions, each offering a full seat and high-back design to refresh your patio, deck, or garden dining set with coordinated comfort.\n\nGenerous 110 x 55cm Size: The large cushion profile fits a wide range of standard outdoor chairs, providing ample support for your back and seat during long outdoor meals or relaxation.\n\nDurable All-Weather Polyester: Made with 100% polyester fabric that resists fading and moisture, these cushions hold up beautifully through sunny afternoons and light rain.\n\nSecure Corner Ties: Integrated ties at the top and bottom keep each cushion firmly attached to your chair frames, helping prevent slipping, sliding, or shifting as you sit.\n\nPlush Padding for Lasting Comfort: Thick fiber fill creates a soft yet supportive seat, while the green lattice pattern adds a fresh, stylish accent to your outdoor living space.","sku":"US-G95QOU","images":["/images/products/B0C6H5XZMZ/1.webp","/images/products/B0C6H5XZMZ/2.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true]},
  "1688-828008656438-c3": {"title":"2 Pack Luxury Hotel Style Cotton Bath Mat Set Extra Thick Absorbent Bathroom Floor Towel Non Slip Jacquard Weave Quick Dry Soft Shower Rug For Bathroom Home Spa 50 x 80 cm (White)","bullets":"Premium 100% Cotton Construction: Crafted from pure natural cotton with a thick jacquard weave, these bath mats deliver a soft and comfortable feel underfoot while offering lasting durability for daily use in busy bathrooms.\n\nSuperior Absorbency and Quick Drying: The dense cotton fibers quickly soak up water after showers or baths, helping keep your floors dry and reducing moisture buildup for a fresher bathroom environment.\n\nNon Slip Design for Added Safety: Engineered to stay securely in place on smooth bathroom floors, providing steady footing and extra stability when stepping out of the shower or tub.\n\nGenerous 2-Piece Set with Large Coverage: Each mat measures 50 x 80cm, offering ample floor coverage for doorways, vanity areas, and shower exits while the two-pack allows convenient placement in multiple bathrooms.\n\nEasy Care and Versatile Use: Machine washable for effortless cleaning, these mats maintain their shape and absorbency wash after wash, making them ideal for home bathrooms, guest suites, hotels, and spas.","sku":"US-XFOXWN","images":["/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/2.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/5.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/1.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/4.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/3.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/7.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,false,false,true,false]},
