  "1688-856468238034": {"title":"Premium 2-Pack Cotton Bath Towels Extra Soft Highly Absorbent 21-Ply Ringspun Cotton Yarn Hotel Spa Quality Large Towels for Bathroom Gym Sports and Travel 140 x 80 cm (Orange)","bullets":"Premium Cotton Construction: Woven from pure cotton with 21-ply yarn, these towels offer a plush, soft feel against the skin. The dense terry loops create a comfortable texture that holds up through daily use.\n\nExcellent Absorbency: Thick cotton fibers quickly wick away moisture after showers, workouts, swimming, or spa visits. The generous pile soaks up water efficiently to leave skin feeling dry and refreshed.\n\nGenerous Full Size: Each towel measures 140 x 80cm, providing ample coverage for adults. The large surface wraps comfortably around the body and works well as a bath towel or travel companion.\n\nVersatile for Any Occasion: Ideal for home bathrooms, hotel suites, gyms, yoga studios, beaches, and camping trips. The solid color design complements a wide range of decor styles.\n\nBuilt to Last: Reinforced edges and quality stitching help prevent fraying over time. Machine washable for easy care, these towels maintain their softness and absorbency through repeated washes.","sku":"US-VK9EJ3","images":["/images/products/1688-856468238034/3.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/6.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/1.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/5.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/4.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/2.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,false,false,true,false]},
